---

<ServiceLayout
  lang={lang}
  title="Event organisation for brands | SEZMOO"
  description="Event organisation at SEZMOO: conferences, trade fairs, launches, company events and special projects. Concept, production, set design, technical and photo/video. Gdańsk, Poland."
  canonical={canonical}
  jsonLd={jsonLd}
>
<div class="sd">
<section class="sd__hero shell">
  <span class="sd__kick reveal"><i></i>Services</span>
  <h1 class="sd__h1 reveal">Event <span style="color:#ffd200">organisation.</span></h1>
  <p class="sd__lead reveal" data-d="1"><b>An event is more than the day itself.</b> We handle the whole process – concept and organisation, set design, branding and production, then running the event, photo, video and communication.</p>
  <p class="sd__lead reveal" data-d="1">Conferences, launches, trade fairs, company events and special projects – delivered end to end or as the part of the production you need.</p>
  <div class="sd__facts reveal" data-d="2">
    <div class="sd__fact"><span>Concept</span><strong>The idea and format</strong></div>
    <div class="sd__fact"><span>Organisation</span><strong>Logistics and prep</strong></div>
    <div class="sd__fact"><span>Coordination</span><strong>Running it on site</strong></div>
    <div class="sd__fact"><span>Photo + video</span><strong>Coverage and aftermovie</strong></div>
  </div>
  <figure class="sd__reel reveal" data-d="1">
    <img src="/assets/optimized/lcp/balet-18ef815c-1920.webp" srcset="/assets/optimized/lcp/balet-18ef815c-800.webp 800w, /assets/optimized/lcp/balet-18ef815c-1280.webp 1280w, /assets/optimized/lcp/balet-18ef815c-1920.webp 1920w" sizes="100vw" width="1920" height="1080" alt="Widowisko" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" />
    <figcaption><b>Widowisko</b><span>Event / live coverage</span></figcaption>
  </figure>
</section>
<div class="sd__body shell">
  <div>
    <section class="sd__blk" id="sd-zakres">
      <div class="sd__blkh reveal"><h2>What we organise</h2></div>
      <details class="sd__g reveal" open><summary><h3>Conferences &amp; business meetings</h3><span class="sd__pm"></span></summary><div class="sd__gin"><p>Full organisation of conferences, seminars, workshops and business meetings – from concept and venue to running the day.</p><div class="sd__tags"><span>Conferences</span><span>Seminars</span><span>Workshops</span><span>Business meetings</span><span>Congresses</span><span>Panel discussions</span></div></div></details>
      <details class="sd__g reveal" open><summary><h3>Trade fairs &amp; exhibitions</h3><span class="sd__pm"></span></summary><div class="sd__gin"><p>We prepare a brand’s presence at fairs and exhibitions: the space, the material, the communication and the content used during the event.</p><div class="sd__tags"><span>Trade fairs</span><span>Exhibitions</span><span>Stands</span><span>Build</span><span>POS material</span><span>Multimedia</span></div></div></details>
      <details class="sd__g reveal" open><summary><h3>Launches &amp; brand events</h3><span class="sd__pm"></span></summary><div class="sd__gin"><p>Product launches, openings, promotional events and customer evenings, with one consistent concept and its visual setting.</p><div class="sd__tags"><span>Product launches</span><span>Openings</span><span>Promotional events</span><span>Customer events</span><span>Brand activations</span><span>Roadshows</span></div></div></details>
      <details class="sd__g reveal"><summary><h3>Company events</h3><span class="sd__pm"></span></summary><div class="sd__gin"><p>Internal and team events – from small team gatherings to larger company occasions.</p><div class="sd__tags"><span>Company events</span><span>Team building</span><span>Anniversaries</span><span>Galas</span><span>Staff meetings</span><span>Employer branding</span></div></div></details>
      <details class="sd__g reveal"><summary><h3>Special projects</h3><span class="sd__pm"></span></summary><div class="sd__gin"><p>Non-standard productions that need an individual concept and real production capacity behind them.</p><div class="sd__tags"><span>Cultural events</span><span>Concerts</span><span>Outdoor events</span><span>Special activations</span></div></div></details>
    </section>
    <section class="sd__blk" id="sd-proces">
      <div class="sd__blkh reveal"><h2>End-to-end event <span style="color:#ffd200">production.</span></h2></div>
      <div class="sd__steps">
        <div class="sd__step reveal"><h3>Concept</h3><p>The idea, the theme, the running order and the schedule.</p></div>
        <div class="sd__step reveal"><h3>Organisation</h3><p>Venue, logistics, suppliers and production coordination.</p></div>
        <div class="sd__step reveal"><h3>Set &amp; materials</h3><p>Space design, signage, build, print and event material.</p></div>
        <div class="sd__step reveal"><h3>Technical</h3><p>Stage, lighting, sound, multimedia and technical solutions.</p></div>
        <div class="sd__step reveal"><h3>Photo &amp; video</h3><p>Coverage, aftermovie, reels, interviews, streaming and material for later.</p></div>
        <div class="sd__step reveal"><h3>Promotion</h3><p>Teasers, creative, social media, campaigns and event communication.</p></div>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="sd__blk" id="sd-work">
      <div class="sd__blkh reveal"><h2>Selected work</h2></div>
      <div class="sd__work">
        <a class="sd__wi reveal" href="/realizacja-exlantix/"><div class="sd__wm"><img src="/assets/portfolio/exlantix/exlantix-premiera-marki-gdansk-fotografia-21.jpg" alt="EXLANTIX – Brand premiere · Event" loading="lazy" /></div><span>Brand premiere · Event</span><h3>EXLANTIX ↗</h3></a>
        <a class="sd__wi reveal" href="/realizacja-denza/"><div class="sd__wm"><img src="/assets/portfolio/denza/denza-z9-gt-premiera-fotografia-03.jpg" alt="DENZA – Z9 GT premiere · Event" loading="lazy" /></div><span>Z9 GT premiere · Event</span><h3>DENZA ↗</h3></a>
        <a class="sd__wi reveal" href="/realizacja-world-of-warships/"><div class="sd__wm"><img src="/assets/work/captains-club-int.avif" alt="World of Warships – Captain's Club · Event" loading="lazy" /></div><span>Captain's Club · Event</span><h3>World of Warships ↗</h3></a>
      </div>
      <div class="sd__more reveal">
        <a class="is-lead" href="/en/portfolio-en/#pt-grid">Full portfolio ↗</a>
        <a href="/en/portfolio-en/?cat=video#pt-grid">Video</a>
        <a href="/en/portfolio-en/?cat=animacje#pt-grid">Animation</a>
        <a href="/en/portfolio-en/?cat=eventy#pt-grid">Events</a>
        <a href="/en/portfolio-en/?cat=grafika#pt-grid">Graphics</a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</div>
</div>
</ServiceLayout>
